Cell["\<\
We parallelize and for each point in \[Eta] we perform a MOnte-Carlo on \
reaction rates to estimate uncertainty\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.722666042792692*^9, 3.7226660656854677`*^9}, 
   3.722709468289233*^9},ExpressionUUID->"cbde6baa-34c5-453c-8179-\
